          "segment": null,
          "value": "Organiser"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "For more information on this tour contact your Group Organiser"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EOnce you have received your Confirmation and Invoice, you can pay your final balance.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "3ca15867-29cb-4c23-a2f1-934fd6a3099c",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETynwald (the Isle of Man Parliament) \u2013 guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECastletown\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECastle Rushen\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESteam train excursion from Castletown to Douglas\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ERamsey\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EManx Electric Railway\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGreat Laxey Wheel\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESnaefell Mountain Railway\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHorse drawn tramway excursion\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPeel Castle\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPeel Cathedral\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHouse of Manannan\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EDouglas\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECregneash Village Folk Museum\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "c4b3a613-0d2c-4470-8d06-f7efea52d6e0",
      "key": "64ceada2-8004-4b8e-8c41-54adb1fb8dab",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyNavigationInPageItems",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": [
            "9b30b94c-0788-4a84-9cbe-8ed58f606792",
            "bba0571f-169a-424a-aa59-0b1d4d2b3d99",
            "cbd666ce-6813-454b-a50f-8a437d1a6561",
            "3ca15867-29cb-4c23-a2f1-934fd6a3099c",
            "fdf06f0d-0230-4a0c-8be6-084738b429f7",
            "b59d4f16-fb43-46fd-9dc7-2dd92bef95de",
            "c6d92054-608a-40ed-b2a0-07165c30984b"
          ]
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "In this page"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "9b30b94c-0788-4a84-9cbe-8ed58f606792",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWe meet at our local pick up points and transfer by private coach to Gatwick Airport for our direct scheduled Easyjet flight to the Isle of Man. On arrival we are met by our Blue Badge guide, and transfer by private coach to Douglas. We then check in at the 4* Mannin Hotel at Douglas where we stay four nights on a half board basis.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis morning we enjoy a guided tour at Tynwald, the Parliament of the Isle of Man. Tynwald is of Norse origin and over 1,000 years old, and is thus the oldest parliament in the world. After free time for lunch at the old Manx capital of Castletown, we continue with our Blue Badge guide to Castle Rushen. Guarding the entrance to Silverburn River and one of England\u0026#39;s best preserved medieval fortresses, the castle was taken by Robert the Bruce in 1313 who occupied the Isle of Man briefly whilst attempting to invade Ireland. The Castletown Steam Railway, opened in 1874 and still running with its original locomotives and the longest line of its type in Britain, takes us from Castletown to Douglas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOur Blue Badge guide meets us at our hotel this morning and accompanies us throughout the day. We firstly enjoy some time at leisure in Ramsey. We then enjoy a scenic excursion from Ramsey to Laxey on the Manx Electric Railway, one of Britain\u0027s longest vintage narrow gauge railways. At Laxey, we explore the Great Laxey Wheel. Dating back to 1854 and known locally as \u0027Lady Isabella\u0027 after the wife of the island\u0027s governor at that time, it is the largest water wheel in the world and was designed by Robert Casement to pump water from the mineshafts. We then board the Snaefell Mountain Railway up to the summit of Snaefell.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWe begin the day with a ride on the Douglas Horse Trams with our Blue Badge guide. The trams were first introduced in 1876 to take advantage of the booming tourist trade in Victorian times and to this day still carry tourists and locals along the promenades. We then visit Peel, one of the world\u0027s smallest cathedral cities with just 3,800 residents. On arrival we see the remains of Peel Castle, occupying the important site of St Patrick\u0027s Isle at Peel. The castle\u0027s curtain wall encircles the ruins of many buildings which are a testimony to the site\u0027s religious and secular importance in Manx history. We then have some free time to explore the narrow lanes leading from the working harbour with their specialist and antique shops. This afternoon we visit Peel Cathedral, consecrated in 1980. Our day concludes with a visit to The House of Manannan heritage visitor centre, where, the Island\u0027s mythological sea god, Manannan, welcomes you to his fascinating Kingdom.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe morning is at leisure in Douglas. With our Blue Badge guide this afternoon we visit the Cregneash Village Folk Museum which provides a living, working illustration of the traditional customs, crafts and skills which characterised the Manx crofter\u0027s way of life. We then transfer to the airport for our direct scheduled Easyjet flight to Gatwick, and onwards private coach travel back to our original pick up points.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENB:\u003C/strong\u003E If you are a member of the National Trust, or a member of the English Heritage, to qualify for the \u00A31,399 per person price, you will need to present a valid membership card on arrival at ALL attractions on the Isle of Mann\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENB:\u003C/strong\u003E Insurance is compulsory but does not need to be bought through Tailored Travel.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFlight details may be subject to change. Price based on twin share. Minimum numbers required. Normal booking conditions apply.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
